---
import CategoryLayout from '../layouts/CategoryLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<CategoryLayout
  categoryId="pdf"
  title={`Free PDF Tools – Merge, Compress, Convert | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description="Free PDF tools to merge, compress and convert PDF files. No sign-up and no watermark. Your PDFs are processed in your browser, never uploaded."
  h1="Free PDF Tools"
>
  <h2>PDF tools that keep your documents private</h2>
  <p>
    PDFs often hold the documents you least want to share: bank statements, contracts,
    certificates, application forms and scanned IDs. The tools on this page work on those
    files inside your own browser. Your PDF is opened and rebuilt on your phone or computer
    and is never sent to a server.
  </p>
  <p>
    Use <a href="/merge-pdf">Merge PDF</a> to join several files into one document, for
    example a form and its supporting pages. Use <a href="/compress-pdf">Compress PDF</a> when
    a portal or email rejects a file for being too large. <a href="/jpg-to-pdf">JPG to PDF</a>
    turns photos of paper documents into a single PDF, and <a href="/pdf-to-jpg">PDF to JPG</a>
    saves pages as images you can share or post.
  </p>
  <p>
    There is no account to create and no watermark on the result. Everything works in a
    mobile browser as well as on a computer. Large PDFs with many pages take longer on older
    phones, because the processing happens on your device rather than on a remote server.
  </p>
</CategoryLayout>
